TEEWARS LEGACY
--------------
Description:
Teewars Legacy is a free online deathmatch game inspiredby Teeworlds. 
Control a small tee, move fast, hook around maps, shoot rivals, and chase a bigger score. 
You can download it and play indefinitely, and this game fully FREE.
--------------
Features:
* 2 Excellent map
* Clear looking graphics
This project is currently in early development (INDEV)
--------------
Controls:
A or arrow left - Move left
D or arrow right - Move right
Space or W - Jump
Left click - Shoot
Right click - Hook
